                                                             <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#correspondsToInverse> <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#HasOffspringAncestor>.
<https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#hasAssociate> a rdf:Property,
                                                                owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                              rdfs:comment "A person (subject) is associated with a group (object), or a group (subject) is associated with a person (object)."@en;
                                                              rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#>;
