                                                             <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#correspondsToInverse> <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#HasMurdereeMurderer>.
<https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#hasMuse> a rdf:Property,
                                                           owl:ObjectProperty;
                                                         rdfs:comment "A person or corporation (subject; e.g. an artist or group of artists) who is inspired by a person (object)."@en;
                                                         rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#>;
                                                         rdfs:label "has muse"@en,
                                                                    "ha musa"@it,
                                                                    "hat Muse"@de,
                                                                    "tiene musa"@es;
