                                                                      "es sujeto"@es,
                                                                      "è soggetto di"@it,
                                                                      "ist Subjekt"@de;
                                                           owl:inverseOf <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#hasSubject>;
                                                           status:term_status "stable".
<https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#isSubjectObject> a owl:ObjectProperty,
                                                                   rdf:Property;
                                                                 rdfs:comment """Something (subject) takes the subject or object role at an n-ary concept's instance (object) of the symmetric relationship meant by the n-ary concept. 
For inverse relationsships, the subject and object role follow the naming of the n-ary concept when reading quasi just the first part of the n-ary concept name."""@en;
                                                                 rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://d-nb.info/standards/elementset/agrelon#>;
